## Context

Claude Code 2.1.277+ loads AGENTS.md, and parent-directory AGENTS.md files
such as ~/CNRS/AGENTS.md, only when a project has no CLAUDE.md (root or
.claude/). maiba has both: a root `@AGENTS.md` shim and the git-erg stub in
`.claude/CLAUDE.md`. The same cleanup landed on 2026-09-23 in
climate-finance-het, padme, aedist, cadens, archiveCIRED, chemin-de-voix,
DOIfetch, livre-milliards-climat and fuzzy-corpus.

maiba cannot follow yet: its store is still `%erg v1`. The stub and
`.claude/rules/tickets.md` describe that format correctly, while the harness
ticket rules (`~/.claude/tickets/AGENTS.md`) describe `%erg 0.1`. Deleting
the stub first would leave agents with rules for the wrong format.
fuzzy-corpus PR #60 is the model migration (vendored binary, archive closed,
retire ticket-* skills).

## Exit criteria
- [ ] `erg migrate tickets/` run; every ticket header reads `%erg 0.1`
- [ ] `tickets/erg` vendored and `tickets/AGENTS.md` present; `tickets/tools/go/` and `.claude/rules/tickets.md` removed
- [ ] `erg check tickets/` passes
- [ ] Root `CLAUDE.md` and `.claude/CLAUDE.md` deleted; the "keep CLAUDE.md = @AGENTS.md" line in AGENTS.md rewritten
- [ ] A fresh session reports "AGENTS.md loaded" for maiba
